WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
After the opening jab, Ryu’s DI meets Ingrid’s counter-DI.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.900
The counter-DI scores Punish Counter and crumples Ryu.

3
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.550
A dash and back-heavy target chain feed medium Sun Flare.

4
00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:07.950
Light Sun Flare stores one Crest during the resulting knockdown.
